New adventuring skill: tailor.

1) Tailor cuts clothing or soft armor to fit another body.
   - Letting a piece out needs cloth of its own material.
   - Taking one in leaves clippings.

2) The clippings are worth keeping.
   - They carry every stat the piece carried, though never its armor.
   - They can be woven back into thread, or handed to a mage.

3) Metal is a smith's work.  See FORGE RESIZE.

See HELP TAILOR.
